  "openAiGuideStep1": "Open platform.openai.com in your browser and sign up or log in with your email.",
  "openAiGuideStep2": "Verify your email if it's your first time. OpenAI may ask for a phone number for security.",
  "openAiGuideStep3": "Go to API keys: platform.openai.com/api-keys (sidebar → API keys).",
  "openAiGuideStep4": "Click «Create new secret key». Name it something you'll recognize, e.g. «FORGEN».",
  "openAiGuideStep5": "Copy the key as soon as it appears. It's shown only once; if you lose it, create a new one.",
  "openAiGuideStep6": "OpenAI may require adding a payment method in Billing before using the API (pay-as-you-go).",
  "openAiGuideStep7": "Return to FORGEN, paste the key above, select OpenAI, and tap «Save API Key».",
  "geminiGuideTitle": "How to get your Gemini API Key (Google)",
  "geminiGuidePortal": "aistudio.google.com/apikey",
  "geminiGuideStep1": "Open aistudio.google.com in your browser and sign in with your Google account.",
  "geminiGuideStep2": "If it's your first time, accept the Google AI Studio terms when prompted.",
  "geminiGuideStep3": "Go to API keys: aistudio.google.com/apikey (menu «Get API key»).",
  "geminiGuideStep4": "Click «Create API key». You can create a new Google Cloud project or use an existing one.",
  "geminiGuideStep5": "Copy the generated API key. Store it safely and never share it publicly.",
  "geminiGuideStep6": "Google offers a free tier with usage limits. Check the console if you need details.",
  "geminiGuideStep7": "Return to FORGEN, paste the key above, select Gemini, and tap «Save API Key».",
  "claudeGuideTitle": "How to get your Claude API Key (Anthropic)",
  "claudeGuidePortal": "console.anthropic.com/settings/keys",
  "claudeGuideStep1": "Open console.anthropic.com and sign in (separate from claude.ai chat if you only use the chat app).",
  "claudeGuideStep2": "Go to Settings → API Keys (console.anthropic.com/settings/keys).",
  "claudeGuideStep3": "Click «Create Key», name it (e.g. FORGEN), and confirm.",
  "claudeGuideStep4": "Copy the generated key. It is shown only once; store it safely.",
  "claudeGuideStep5": "Anthropic bills API usage separately (your Claude Pro chat plan does not cover API calls).",
  "claudeGuideStep6": "Return to FORGEN, paste the key, select Claude, and tap «Save API Key».",
